{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfghyYEh9LX6dAwHnbyaM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote the candidate, `ending_switch_recency_rule_built`, and the self-check printed `OK`. On its short smoke fit it scored ELPD-LOO −3262.0, against −3266.1 for the incumbent's full fit. That comparison doesn't show much: the smoke fit used a single chain, so R-hat couldn't be computed and convergence wasn't verified. Its LOO estimate is also flagged unreliable, with 15.7% of trials having a high Pareto k. Admission's full fit is the real test.\n\n**What I changed:** this refines the incumbent `person_switch_ideal_pattern_rule_built` by adding one shared reward for a sequence that ends on a switch (its last two flips differ). The idea is that people weigh the end of a sequence most, and a final repeat reads like a streak starting.\n\nThis targets the critique's strongest result: among pairs with the same number of switches, people choose the sequence that ends with a switch more often than the incumbent predicts (0.521 observed vs 0.458; p = 0.010, q = 0.080). That result doesn't survive the false-discovery correction, so it is the best available signal rather than a confirmed one.\n\n**In the code:**\n- One new feature, `end_sw_diff`: whether sequence A ends with a switch minus whether sequence B does.\n- One new parameter, `delta` (prior Normal(0, 1)), added to the choice score.\n- Everything else is the incumbent's code unchanged.\n\n**Not checked yet:**\n- **Novelty:** if `delta` comes out near zero, its predictions may be too close to the incumbent's and the novelty gate will reject it.\n- **Convergence and speed:** the smoke fit took 217 seconds, so the full fit should finish within the 30-minute limit, but that is untested.\n\nThe files are `hypothesis.md`, `model_name.txt` and `candidate.py` in `/scratch/users/kushinm/auto-psych/outer_loop_live/run2/data/subjective_randomness/experiment3/model_loop/iter_3/candidate_3/`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":78953,"cache_read_input_tokens":11602,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":78953,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":685,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e39b4f3a-afdb-41fb-88f6-919c1b6e91b6","uuid":"5db27abb-f8b4-4680-b5e3-b2b74b5cf501","timestamp":"2026-10-04T06:16:04.334Z","request_id":"req_011CfghyXNcGFWAWAczRk1uy"}
